

Usage:	LIBCOP	libfile  [name [,name ...]] [@cmdfile]	options

Only one of following options/invocation: Add,Delete,List,Replace,Update

/Add			- add module(s) to library
/[NO]Backup		- enable/disable creation of backup library
/Delete 		- delete module(s) from library. Warning if module
			  does not exist in library
/[NO]Echo		- enable/disable echoing of lines in command files
/List[=file]		- specify listing file [default extension = .lis]
/Replace		- replace module(s) in library
/Update 		- replace module(s) in library with newer object
/[NO]Warnings		- enable/disable warning messages









?-
